{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10333420","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10333420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1033342001:1":{"text":"가시나무 근위대를 만날까 봐요.","source_cn":"我担心会碰到荆棘卫队。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4793582327916228","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가시나무 근위대를 만날까 봐요.","female":"가시나무 근위대를 만날까 봐요.","variant_male_record_index":"108321","variant_female_record_index":"108322","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1033342002:1":{"text":"가시나무 근위대는 난민만 쫓아내잖아. 우린 아무 일 없겠지.","source_cn":"他们不是只驱赶难民么，应该对我们没什么影响吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33E00F812F7CDF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1033342003:1":{"text":"아니, 가시나무는 숲 전체를 봉쇄하려고 해!","source_cn":"我纠正一下，荆棘是要封锁丛林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66E50D422670B339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1033342004:1":{"text":"봉쇄는 난민만을 대상으로 하는 게 아니야. 우리도 숲 밖과의 접촉이 금지될 거라고.","source_cn":"所谓的封锁自然不止是针对难民——我们也会被禁止和丛林外接触。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1677C894A97879","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1033342005:1":{"text":"그러니 우리가 숲 밖에서 물건을 팔아치운다고 해도 돌아오는 길에 가시나무 근위대를 만나면 검문에다가 압수까지 당할 거야.","source_cn":"所以就算我们在丛林外卖掉货物，万一回来时遇见荆棘卫队，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E3467638D7A06C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1033342006:1":{"text":"하이드맨 기억해? 그냥 몇 마디 대들었을 뿐인데 결국...","source_cn":"你还记得海德曼吗？他不过多说了两句，结果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C7667BE1A845AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民普瑞奇":{"text":"프리치","source":"村民普瑞奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民珀尔":{"text":"펄","source":"村民珀尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}